# Realtime Auction Arena deterministic auction rules.
#
# This module implements parseable, pure rule helpers inside the currently
# supported SemanticScript operation surface. It deliberately avoids persistence,
# JSON, SSE, wall-clock reads, mutation of records, and alias conversion.
# Callers pass primitive scalar snapshots extracted from records and receive
# primitive reason codes or scalar results. `models.sem` remains the durable
# contract layer for the richer aliases and enums.

module app.realtime_auction_arena.server.auction_domain
purpose module app.realtime_auction_arena.server.auction_domain "Deterministic auction policy, lifecycle, bid, anti-sniping, and winner-selection rule helpers."
moduleOwns app.realtime_auction_arena.server.auction_domain "Pure rule decisions that map model facts to stable enum reason codes and scalar transition results."
moduleDoesNotOwn app.realtime_auction_arena.server.auction_domain "HTTP API authorization plumbing, database transactions, event persistence, idempotency caches, request logging, or SSE broadcast."
invariant module app.realtime_auction_arena.server.auction_domain "Every operation is deterministic: identical scalar inputs return identical outputs and perform no IO."
moduleWarning app.realtime_auction_arena.server.auction_domain "TODO(runtime): replace primitive scalar parameter lists with record-by-value inputs and explicit alias conversion helpers once record field reads across module boundaries are fully supported by the compiler."
moduleWarning app.realtime_auction_arena.server.auction_domain "TODO(runtime): add complete command-to-event construction once tagged event variants and typed JSON codecs are available."

exportOperation app.realtime_auction_arena.server.auction_domain validateAuctionPolicy
